Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.04,0:00:01.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Researchers interrupted sleep
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.66,0:00:03.09,Default,,0,0,0,,in sixteen healthy people.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.62,0:00:05.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Six isolated sleep-paralysis episodes
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.92,0:00:06.37,Default,,0,0,0,,followed:
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.00,0:00:08.83,Default,,0,0,0,,one, two, three, four,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.96,0:00:09.97,Default,,0,0,0,,five, six.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.56,0:00:12.04,Default,,0,0,0,,They slept, were awakened
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.04,0:00:13.60,Default,,0,0,0,,at selected times, stayed
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.60,0:00:14.43,Default,,0,0,0,,awake for an hour,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.60,0:00:15.60,Default,,0,0,0,,then returned to bed
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.60,0:00:16.89,Default,,0,0,0,,under polysomnography.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.48,0:00:18.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Across four nights, the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.66,0:00:19.94,Default,,0,0,0,,episodes appeared under that
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.94,0:00:21.48,Default,,0,0,0,,protocol, but not after
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.48,0:00:22.78,Default,,0,0,0,,every interruption or in
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.78,0:00:23.79,Default,,0,0,0,,every participant.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.36,0:00:25.96,Default,,0,0,0,,When they occurred, participants
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.96,0:00:26.56,Default,,0,0,0,,knew they were in
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.56,0:00:27.34,Default,,0,0,0,,the lab and could
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.34,0:00:28.01,Default,,0,0,0,,not move.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.58,0:00:29.56,Default,,0,0,0,,All but one also
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.56,0:00:31.20,Default,,0,0,0,,reported disturbing visual or
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.20,0:00:32.57,Default,,0,0,0,,auditory experiences.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.38,0:00:34.46,Default,,0,0,0,,The recordings caught the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.47,0:00:35.23,Default,,0,0,0,,contradiction:
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.52,0:00:37.00,Default,,0,0,0,,waking awareness while muscle
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.01,0:00:38.15,Default,,0,0,0,,atonia persisted.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.60,0:00:39.87,Default,,0,0,0,,The doorway was measurable.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.26,0:00:40.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did the room
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.96,0:00:42.43,Default,,0,0,0,,sometimes feel occupied?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.12,0:00:44.30,Default,,0,0,0,,The full experiment is
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.31,0:00:44.75,Default,,0,0,0,,linked.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.44,0:00:47.32,Default,,0,0,0,,BODY, BRAIN, or PRESENCE—which
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.32,0:00:48.43,Default,,0,0,0,,unsettles you most?
